    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a61afb66356eb2d9be71360</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 23 Jul 2026 06:10:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>话不多说，直接上图吧~</span></p><p><span>山门封住了，现在从侧面门进来就是这样一个场景》》》》</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nnBan-KEKyVAElT2QRNeqRhg1X-m.JPG"><p><span>天王殿里的两个展板》》》》</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fuv_6AVBMDHgnZHmUkABSqSHvIwW.JPG"><p><span>还挺好奇这个高碑店博物馆的》》》》</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrZ176gDa5gWrJzkKLPncC79wqGG.JPG"><p><span>补间铺作是怎么连接在阑额上的呢》》》》</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjijBq_AqnxWK7ORXSosuRuW_Yb_.JPG"><p><span>里转揭晓答案——蜀柱》》》》</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv_9pCx00R1BkF5t9JLijbjp0OuO.JPG"><p><span>大转角》》》》</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FijxR04yOuFJ9z8LqSaRggoD1JBr.JPG"><p><span>6=3+3》》》》</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhE471FV5xLdXmL2v0tXPpYR1mNK.JPG"><p><span>移柱减柱乾坤大挪移》》》》</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpATqdautq69-l9qwQwgZagDAuN7.JPG"><p><span>墙里夹着的唐代千手千眼观音》》》》</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlTnYDf_bgTTUQKR2W0FIUEyVeJY.JPG"><p><span>这个细节啧啧啧》》》》</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhO0n7ySZXB8jM1TbH9DBEDrpsr2.JPG"><p><span>悄悄说一下，这位大哥/大叔可能是个扫地僧》》》》</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nsMwZESsOC5eMzHcSK_ZqxEvthtY.JPG"><p><span>肌理，纹路，千年》》》》</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoY33UKdzod-XkJ8CUHMR4liaXQF.JPG"><p><span>唐柱》》》》</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fih_EgG8thkdac6fIGWqgLckx2UN.JPG"><p><span>鸟儿来此饮水》》》》</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpL9OLG3fN0WvipnXey7lUZvKG8V.JPG"><p><span>人都会走掉和消失，古物彼此相伴》》》》</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nkOo2qhnLUDEuwQU6nmnFP7ez0AT.JPG"><p><span>铁钟倒是个新鲜物件》》》》</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FstehKjLRcmahwlCcPp2Q6bNoDJj.JPG"><p><span>换个角度，石碑是嘉靖年间的》》》》</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nlpjm55rIsSXZrzxh0qynlXTxMFm.JPG"><p><span>进入好吃的环节》》》》</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrkxFqmkr_HCmK-5T0acP-dCZNnX.JPG"><p><span>忘了拍豆腐丝了，看看烧饼夹肉吧》》》》</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmhSZ52iEQjsgLlVjvySJJ-HH01W.JPG"><p></p>]]></description>
